WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.767
Count the toys: your child touches each thing, and Pibbo counts along.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.212
One touch, one number. Each toy says the next number and shows it, marked by shape

00:00:15.212 --> 00:00:19.208
as well as colour. Touch it again, and the count doesn't move.

00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:31.067
On a phone or a wide desktop it's the same round, with more room and no more things.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.276
When every toy is counted, Pibbo asks how many, and offers numerals to choose from.

00:00:46.457 --> 00:00:51.430
A wrong answer is a chance to try again. Nothing is taken away: Pibbo counts the

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:54.279
toys again, and your child chooses again.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:03.449
The right one earns a short yes, and the next round is ready straight away.

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:14.457
The tests prove it: one touch, one number, a kind retry, and nothing to scroll.

00:01:20.009 --> 00:01:23.711
Pibbo helps young children learn to count and to sound out words.

00:01:24.056 --> 00:01:28.566
A child opens it on whatever screen is to hand, picks an activity, and plays:

00:01:28.566 --> 00:01:33.370
counting the things in front of them, and saying each sound of a word and blending

00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:35.134
the sounds into the word.
